      "expectation": "accept",
      "description": "Reference settlement-evidence binding: a captured avm-proofpack bundle bound to a round-bearing settlement attestation. bundle_sha256 is SHA-256 of dump_bundle's indent-2/sort_keys bytes; settled_payment_ref recomputes from (tenant, tx, network); round == bundle.round == attestation_settlement_round; chain_genesis_id == bundle.genesis_id; the bundle verifies.",
      "binding": {
